WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.449
- [Voiceover] Warning,
if the following video

00:00:03.449 --> 00:00:07.878
is relatable to you, you may
be suffering from workaholism.

00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:10.295
(slow music)

00:00:12.646 --> 00:00:14.479
You work way too much.

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:17.332
You're the first to arrive at the office

00:00:17.332 --> 00:00:19.165
and the last to leave.

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:22.394
Work is your happy place.

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:25.709
You come to work even
when you're deathly ill,

00:00:25.709 --> 00:00:30.303
indifferent to spreading your
nasty germs to your coworkers.

00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:32.314
Your body hates you.

00:00:32.314 --> 00:00:35.727
You have no concept of work/life balance.

00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:38.626
Your idea of leisure is
watching the occasional episode

00:00:38.626 --> 00:00:41.692
of Parks and Recreation before turning in.

00:00:41.692 --> 00:00:42.932
- Ha!

00:00:42.932 --> 00:00:46.970
- [Voiceover] You always work
when you're not supposed to.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.963
You have neglected all the
relationships in your life,

00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:52.818
cancelling plans so you
can get a head start

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.147
on next week's work.

00:00:55.147 --> 00:00:57.046
Your social life has been diminished

00:00:57.046 --> 00:01:01.533
to occasionally liking your
college buddy's Facebook posts.

00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:04.263
Let's not even get started
on your dating life,

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:06.133
which is nearly non-existent.

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:09.296
- [Woman] So, what do you do for work?

00:01:09.296 --> 00:01:11.546
- Well, I do data analysis.

00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:14.260
If you're having fun at work

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.537
you never work a day in your life,

00:01:16.537 --> 00:01:18.686
and I've been on vacay for five years now,

00:01:18.686 --> 00:01:19.903
you hear what I'm saying?

00:01:19.903 --> 00:01:22.100
- [Voiceover] Your friends
try to set you up on dates

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.990
but you have completely
lost the ability to connect.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:27.407
- I say data instead of data,

00:01:28.561 --> 00:01:30.199
just to pretend like I'm
British or something.

00:01:30.199 --> 00:01:31.486
(laughing)

00:01:31.486 --> 00:01:32.623
You all right?

00:01:32.623 --> 00:01:33.456
Oh man.

00:01:34.586 --> 00:01:37.281
- [Voiceover] You just can't stop working.

00:01:37.281 --> 00:01:41.202
If you fit into three or
more of these categories

00:01:41.202 --> 00:01:44.202
you are officially addicted to work.

